# Request
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped target_pose
---
# Result
bool success
uint8 OK=0           # accepted, planned and executed
uint8 REJECTED=1     # accepted, but MoveIt could not plan; arm did not move
uint8 ERROR=2        # plan valid, execution failed; node goes to ERROR
uint8 CANCELED=3     # canceled by the client
uint8 STOPPED=4      # interrupted by e-stop or deactivation
uint8 code
---
# Feedback
string stage
